0056 ground-ink: `Styled::ground(ground, ink)` sets a background and draws what is inside the element (text, icons, underlines) in `ink` while it is on that ground, whatever color each names (`Style::ink`, `Window::element_ink`, `with_element_ink`); under an opaque background of its own, a hover's in place of the ground included, each takes its own color again, under a see-through one its parent's ink

